# TARTARUS UPLINK v3

Read `AGENTS.md`, `VIBECODING.md`, and `LEARNING.md` before editing.

- App lives in `public/` — ES modules under `public/js/`, styles in `public/css/`.
- Run via `npm run dev` — OpenRouter proxied at `POST /api/chat`; key in `.env` only.
- Keep `DISPATCH_CORE` in `public/js/prompts.js` exact; curriculum layer is `DISPATCH_WINDOWS_CURRICULUM`.
- Chill UX: no timers, HINT/STUCK without penalty, debrief → field notes.
- Windows/help desk focus; no real shell execution.
- ADHD-friendly: FOCUS mode, NOW DOING strip, calm labels toggle.
